# 8-byte CAN frame (ID 0x1) and receives the frame the OTHER node sent,
# confirmed by matching payload bytes (f0 f1 f2 f3 f4 f5 f6 f7) observed
# independently on both sockets. This is real firmware, on two independently
# simulated MCUs, exchanging real CAN frames over a shared virtual bus -
